msgid "⟪k:0⟫I tossed the arm—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s arm—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the man had given me into the lake."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Joguei o braço—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o braço de Morgana—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫que o homem me deu no lago."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1e92dae28808d17381739939b3fbad6d0573cf444de6adb78aeccebd92d082e
#. default-sha256: e70ceea1f162ce6e6693452818a23366d1cdaca02156d1ab952b5cdbd73b6f18
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I tried to convince myself it was all a dream—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫some terrible nightmare—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"but I could still feel the warmth of her skin fresh on my hands,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu tentei me convencer de que tudo era um sonho—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫algum pesadelo terrível—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"mas eu ainda conseguia sentir o calor da sua pele fresco nas minhas mãos,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ed75cc975c3ceadd9e6329eb0d73eb51b3f6a0d7537bffa50d74feee130dce6
#. default-sha256: 31b8e8788c4c48416674b58a0e5b78474ab2fe5b0781efa41e4da5ff309dd1de
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mind couldn’t keep up with the flood of thoughts and emotions and images. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted "
"to close my eyes, but I was too afraid I would find the bloodbath in the cottage on the back of "
"my eyelids,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Minha mente não conseguia acompanhar a enxurrada de pensamentos, emoções e imagens. ⟪k:1⟫Eu "
"queria fechar os olhos, mas estava com muito medo de encontrar na parte de trás das minhas "
"pálpebras o banho de sangue na cabana,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d331f9ab5377535bfbba425ebaac994363cfccf190d1394f98f75070129c556
#. default-sha256: d23eedba880ce188867a8c9a2e417e53873bc84ad86c9d6607834aaea23cb4dc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I didn’t want to admit it was my fault...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t want to accept that I had "
"caused it..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas não queria admitir que a culpa era minha...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não queria aceitar que eu tinha "
"causado isso..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_416CD908_EF6D_4F8D_9FF2_8B9BE9D51255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd9ab0c10e11d6d56175d0723b0a065456e0fcb3fb1f058392f5d288f94632f9
