msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mas posso apostar que eu devia estar horrível."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1FC153A0_693A_4ADF_A944_6DC8C27F7142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
